title: sparring_pitch
---
Samson: Nothing serious. A sparring match. The body remembers what the mind tries to forget — and yours looks like it's forgetting fast.
-> Fine. Where?
    <<fire_event samson_q1_accepted>>
    <<jump sparring_accept>>
