title: backstory
---
Samson: Long enough to know who belongs here and who's just passing through. You belong here. That's not a compliment. It means you've got work to do.
-> What kind of work?
    <<jump sparring_pitch>>
-> I'll manage on my own.
    <<stop>>
===
title: sparring_accept
---
Samson: Good. The dojo. Sundown. Don't be late — and don't hold back. I want to see what you're actually made of.
-> Understood.
    <<stop>>
===
title: sparring_refuse
---
Samson: Suit yourself. But you'll need sharper instincts than that when it counts. Find me when you're ready.
-> Alright. Maybe later.
    <<stop>>
